# Suricata Network Intrusion Detection System - Classification Configuration
#
# This file defines the classification entries used by Suricata to categorize
# detected events. Each entry consists of a short name, a human-readable
# description, and a priority level (lower number = higher priority).
#
# Format: config classification: <shortname>,<description>,<priority>

